From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: howeasy <howardabudd@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 10:20:35 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] slink: Polished Crystal wild encounters

PolishedCrystalRomHandler reads and writes wild encounters: the eight
grass/surf tables (morn/day/nite sets, or the day set for all three),
swarms, the 15 fishing groups (one set per distinct rod list), the
headbutt/rock-smash sets and the bug contest. Writes are same-size and in
place: a changed Pokemon rewrites only the slot's two species bytes with
NO_FORM, a level byte changes only under a level setting and never when it
is a LEVEL_FROM_BADGES encoding, and formed slots and fishing's species-0
time rows are never written. EGG, the unused $100, Unown and every variant
form are banned from wild pools. Every other writer still throws.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
